      "action": "keep",
      "reason": "The claim that there is no evidence of documented confirmation between Utilities and RHOB regarding the air-low alarm understanding remains unknown. The provided text confirms a pressure drop and an 'air-low' indication but does not contain explicit records (e.g., signed logs, radio transcripts) proving mutual acknowledgment or shared mental models at the moment of interruption.",
